# CodeForge does NOT load environment variables from the repo root.
#
# Canonical backend config:
#   1. Copy server/.env.example → server/.env
#   2. Fill in GEMINI_API_KEY and/or GROQ_API_KEY
#   3. Or set USE_MOCK_LLM=true for offline/CI
#
# Frontend (optional, production deploys):
#   client/.env.example → client/.env
#   VITE_WS_URL points at your backend host
#
# See README.md → Environment variables
